  "details": "Since the update to Build 1864, whenever I play in certain worlds, Easy Anti-Cheat invariably displays a “Disconnected” error after about one minute, forcing me back to the Home World and preventing me from continuing to play.\n\nI have confirmed that this error occurs in the following worlds:\n\n・Rhapsody ep. 1 - Grave (wrld_b999a5e6-5ea9-4120-bd88-f8db385bbca6)\n\n・Rhapsody ep. 2 - Scherzando (wrld_241bfaf5-8c8e-4805-8c33-8f6087e65eaf)\n\nIn these worlds, teleporting to almost any area—excluding Mirage Cape and the starting area—will invariably trigger an EAC error within about one minute.\n\nThis issue occurs regardless of whether you’re in desktop mode or VR mode, and numerous users have reported the same symptoms.",
